{"3446160": {"success": true, "data": {"type": "game", "name": "Where the Wisteria Ends", "steam_appid": 3446160, "required_age": 0, "is_free": false, "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Where the Wisteria Ends is an unsettling, <strong>story-driven horror RPG where karma is permanent. </strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Shizume, a quiet mountainside village, waits for you beneath a canopy of wisteria. Under its serene surface, you are watched by <strong><i>the one</i></strong> who remembers  every sin you commit.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Cultivate your fields, care for beasts, and walk among villagers who fear what lurks beyond their doors. The land beyond the village never sleeps, and the sea carries whispers meant for you alone. <strong>Will you answer?</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3446160/extras/c50064329b6229fa8f60c84b6ff13c64.poster.avif?t=1784230574\" width=297 height=54 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3446160/extras/c50064329b6229fa8f60c84b6ff13c64.webm?t=1784230574\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Every deed, kind or cruel, is etched into the world. Your karma reshapes the environment, alters storylines, and changes how the villagers of Shizume see you. When dire consequences strike, there is no reset. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><picture><source srcset=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3446160/extras/02a66e271ceb30213a0ab4f121d2097d.gif?t=1784230574\"><img src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3446160/extras/02a66e271ceb30213a0ab4f121d2097d.poster.avif?t=1784230574\" class=\"bb_img\" /></picture></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Grow crops across shifting seasons, raise traditional livestock, and shelter the demons you've managed to tame. What you feed, protect, or abandon will not forget your guiding hand.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><picture><source srcset=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3446160/extras/edfa1d27ec9b81f30dc64f6e234f5f3a.webp?t=1784230574\"><img src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3446160/extras/edfa1d27ec9b81f30dc64f6e234f5f3a.poster.avif?t=1784230574\" class=\"bb_img\" width=297 height=54 /></picture></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Build friendship or romance with the people of Shizume. Every interaction impacts what they'll do for you (or to you) when fear begins to spread. Connection is possible, but so is permanent loss.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><picture><source srcset=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3446160/extras/0bb5c64e4a45f5df9eb3edd03165553c.gif?t=1784230574\"><img src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3446160/extras/0bb5c64e4a45f5df9eb3edd03165553c.poster.avif?t=1784230574\" class=\"bb_img\" /></picture></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Explore a mountainside village  inspired by rural Japan, where nature and folklore intertwine. Hand-pixeled environments capture the beauty of a quiet culture and a world that's  familiar yet haunting.</p>", "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Where the Wisteria Ends is an unsettling, <strong>story-driven horror RPG where karma is permanent. </strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Shizume, a quiet mountainside village, waits for you beneath a canopy of wisteria. Under its serene surface, you are watched by <strong><i>the one</i></strong> who remembers  every sin you commit.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Cultivate your fields, care for beasts, and walk among villagers who fear what lurks beyond their doors. The land beyond the village never sleeps, and the sea carries whispers meant for you alone. <strong>Will you answer?</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3446160/extras/c50064329b6229fa8f60c84b6ff13c64.poster.avif?t=1784230574\" width=297 height=54 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3446160/extras/c50064329b6229fa8f60c84b6ff13c64.webm?t=1784230574\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Every deed, kind or cruel, is etched into the world. Your karma reshapes the environment, alters storylines, and changes how the villagers of Shizume see you. When dire consequences strike, there is no reset. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><picture><source srcset=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3446160/extras/02a66e271ceb30213a0ab4f121d2097d.gif?t=1784230574\"><img src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3446160/extras/02a66e271ceb30213a0ab4f121d2097d.poster.avif?t=1784230574\" class=\"bb_img\" /></picture></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Grow crops across shifting seasons, raise traditional livestock, and shelter the demons you've managed to tame. What you feed, protect, or abandon will not forget your guiding hand.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><picture><source srcset=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3446160/extras/edfa1d27ec9b81f30dc64f6e234f5f3a.webp?t=1784230574\"><img src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3446160/extras/edfa1d27ec9b81f30dc64f6e234f5f3a.poster.avif?t=1784230574\" class=\"bb_img\" width=297 height=54 /></picture></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Build friendship or romance with the people of Shizume. Every interaction impacts what they'll do for you (or to you) when fear begins to spread. Connection is possible, but so is permanent loss.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><picture><source srcset=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3446160/extras/0bb5c64e4a45f5df9eb3edd03165553c.gif?t=1784230574\"><img src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3446160/extras/0bb5c64e4a45f5df9eb3edd03165553c.poster.avif?t=1784230574\" class=\"bb_img\" /></picture></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Explore a mountainside village  inspired by rural Japan, where nature and folklore intertwine. Hand-pixeled environments capture the beauty of a quiet culture and a world that's  familiar yet haunting.</p>", "short_description": "A story-driven horror RPG where disturbing questlines and creatures hide beneath life-sim comfort. The karma system is designed to push the boundaries of your humanity. Every choice ripples outward, sealing the fate of a mountainside village, its people, and you.", "supported_languages": "English", "header_image": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3446160/96fa5fa5306697cc6531e56fafba23aaf38fb261/header.jpg?t=1784230574", "capsule_image": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3446160/1178ac459277e3daa8d84911d35150b74995b1f4/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1784230574", "capsule_imagev5": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3446160/1178ac459277e3daa8d84911d35150b74995b1f4/caps